    "description": "<p data-local-id=\"96d2a732007b\"><strong>Context</strong>\nTwo separate small UX asks from Emily and Allie (WagerTech BA) on the Log Sign-Up form.</p><p data-local-id=\"f7ecf6b6910d\"><strong>Requirements</strong></p><ul data-local-id=\"4f5455f8bf4a\"><li data-local-id=\"060980b1f406\"><p data-local-id=\"9349de0a74c9\">Reposition the &quot;Deposit Amount Differs&quot; field beside the &quot;Deposit Amount&quot; field.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"66cd65997f78\"><p data-local-id=\"f4e2884ccb65\">Put First Wager Date and First Wager Proof URL in line (same row), rather than stacked.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"35d21629a2dd\"><p data-local-id=\"f6fe97b00198\">When &quot;Deposit Amount Differs&quot; is selected, push the wager section down to accommodate it (conditional layout shift).</p></li><li data-local-id=\"e7dfb90ec35a\"><p data-local-id=\"27cd4a5732b2\">Add a general &quot;Notes&quot; field to the sign-up form. Repurpose the existing &quot;Referral Notes&quot; field into this general-purpose Notes field, and move it into its own full-width section of the form (rather than inline with other fields).</p><ul data-local-id=\"60e02b1c1cec\"><li data-local-id=\"6d2bc56e5980\"><p data-local-id=\"82adcc5575e2\"><s>In the Record page, leave it in the Referrals section for now until we have further feedback. </s></p></li></ul></li><li data-local-id=\"93e61be4ef69\"><p data-local-id=\"58ccf7cf0d03\">Move the &quot;No Referrer&quot; checkbox to where Referral Notes currently sits, since Notes is moving to its own section.</p></li><li data-local-id=\"4779f4b96dac\"><p data-local-id=\"03465f14bcf2\">The updates above should apply to Edits on the record page and the Log Sign Up / Complete Sign Up screenflows. </p></li></ul><p data-local-id=\"7b40b4f70f87\"><strong>Constraints / Dependencies</strong>\nNone called out.</p><p data-local-id=\"f73f2ec978b2\"><strong>Source</strong>\nFathom — WagerTech &lt;&gt; Jumpr Weekly Sync, 09/23/2026 (https://fathom.video/calls/831090060) — Emily Vandenberg ~33:00–35:44 (layout), Lina Ceniccola ~34:49–35:27, Kobi Kunasekaran ~35:27–35:44 (Notes). Also Emily&#039;s written notes (&quot;Put Deposit Amount Differs beside Dep Amount, push down Wager Line if selected&quot;; &quot;Put First Wager Date and First Wager Proof URL In line&quot;; &quot;Add a Notes Section for SIGNUP&quot;) and Taryn&#039;s handwritten notes, Sign-ups &gt; &quot;Add &#039;Notes&#039; within the sign up form.&quot;</p>",
